    "chunk_text": "\u00feam men \u00fee gyrn\u00f0 sacerdhades. Gif se m\u00e6ssepreost geleahtrod w\u00e6s mid heaofdlicum leahtrum \u00e6r he gehadod w\u00e6re & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6r andette Be m\u00e6ssepreostum. Gif m\u00e6ssepreost o\u00f0\u00f0e diacon man ofslea o\u00f0\u00f0e hi forswerigen, \u00feolian heora hades, & gif hi to bote Eft be godes \u00feeowum. Godes sacerdas & diaconas & o\u00f0re godes \u00feeowas \u00fee on godes temple gode \u00feenian sceolon & haligdom \u00deonne gif \u00e6nig swa gerad man on h\u00e6med\u00feing befealle, andette his scrifte & bete swa he him t\u00e6ce. For\u00feam se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0, beon ge halige, for\u00feam \u00fee ic drihten god & eower hlaford eom halig. Be \u00feam hu se sacerd hine healdan sceal & se diacon. \u00d0a sacerdas & diaconas & \u00fea godes \u00feeowas \u00fee hi sylfe ne magon ne nella\u00f0 for gode \u00fea cl\u00e6nnesse Be \u00feam bisceopum & be o\u00f0rum godes \u00feeowum. So\u00f0lice eallunga is forboden on haligum bocum \u00e6lcon bisceope & abbude & m\u00e6ssepreoste, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Ge eac swylce \u00e6lcon godes \u00feeowe \u00fee on cl\u00e6nnesse gode \u00feeowian scyle is forboden, \u00fe\u00e6t he na\u00f0er ne Be \u00feam gehadedum mannum \u00fee heora feoh l\u00e6na\u00f0 to hyre. Gif bisceop o\u00f0\u00f0e m\u00e6ssepreost o\u00f0\u00f0e hwylc godes \u00feeow l\u00e6n\u00f0 his feoh to unrihtum gafole & ne geman Gif hwa \u00feis abrec\u00f0, ne bi\u00f0 he wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he husl underfo, \u00e6r",
